@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Camera Frame" as Frame
rectangle "Pose / Movement Telemetry" as Telemetry
rectangle "Rep Metrics" as Metrics
rectangle "Form Events + Rule Evidence" as Events
rectangle "Tracking / Calibration Debug Events" as Tracking
rectangle "Daily Sleep / Nutrition Summary" as Daily
rectangle "Weekly Body Composition\n(weight + body fat)" as Weekly
rectangle "Health Connect Fine-grained Records" as Health
rectangle "Debug Video\n(opt-in only)" as Video
rectangle "Room / SQLite" as Room
rectangle "App-private no-backup storage" as Files

Frame --> Telemetry : infer pose
Frame --> Video : only in explicit debug mode
Frame --> Frame : discard immediately after processing
Telemetry --> Room : retain 7 days
Tracking --> Room : retain 7 days
Metrics --> Room : long-term
Events --> Room : long-term
Daily --> Room : long-term compact summary
Weekly --> Room : long-term weekly snapshot
Health --> Room : temporary / normalized cache only
Video --> Files : retain <= 7 days

note right of Telemetry
High-frequency raw movement telemetry is a short-term
debug/re-analysis window only.
Delete after 7 days.
Keep compact/downsampled rep traces only if useful long-term.
end note

note right of Weekly
One snapshot per week.
Prefer median of valid measurements from that week.
Do not permanently copy every weight/body-fat reading.
end note

note right of Metrics
Keep durable derived metrics because they are small
and useful for longitudinal trend analysis.
end note

note right of Events
Persist rule id/version and exact evidence
so decisions remain explainable.
end note

note right of Video
OFF by default.
App-private/no-backup storage only.
Delete after at most 7 days.
Manual export is the only allowed path out of the app sandbox.
end note

note bottom of Room
Real personal data stays on-device only.
Android cloud backup must be disabled.
No automatic export/sync path to GitHub or Google Drive.
end note

@enduml
